       CALL-ZUW01RBG-001.
               CALL 'ZUW01RBG' USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZUW01RBG FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
